<Placemark><name>Downtown - South &amp; Waterfront (5 works)</name><description>South of Front St, Bathurst St to Broadview Ave. 5 works in the dataset.</description><styleUrl>#sw</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-79.40210,43.64240,0 -79.38420,43.64540,0 -79.37650,43.64710,0 -79.34760,43.65360,0 -79.34700,43.64700,0 -79.37400,43.64080,0 -79.40050,43.63810,0 -79.40210,43.64240,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Downtown - West (4 works)</name><description>University Ave to Bathurst St, Front St to Bloor St. 4 works in the dataset.</description><styleUrl>#we</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-79.40210,43.64240,0 -79.38420,43.64540,0 -79.38650,43.65080,0 -79.39380,43.66760,0 -79.41150,43.66650,0 -79.40210,43.64240,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Downtown - Business Core (14 works)</name><description>Front St to Queen St, Yonge to University. 14 works in the dataset.</description><styleUrl>#bc</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-79.38420,43.64540,0 -79.37650,43.64710,0 -79.37900,43.65240,0 -79.38650,43.65080,0 -79.38420,43.64540,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Downtown - Midtown (14 works)</name><description>Queen St to Bloor St, University Ave to Jarvis St. The Bloor Corridor extends beyond these limits. 14 works in the dataset.</description><styleUrl>#mt</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-79.38650,43.65080,0 -79.37900,43.65240,0 -79.37220,43.65400,0 -79.37890,43.67250,0 -79.39380,43.66760,0 -79.38650,43.65080,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Downtown - East (6 works)</name><description>Yonge St to Broadview Ave, north to Bloor St, outside the Midtown area. 6 works in the dataset.</description><styleUrl>#ea</styleUrl><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>-79.37650,43.64710,0 -79.34760,43.65360,0 -79.35860,43.67710,0 -79.37890,43.67250,0 -79.37220,43.65400,0 -79.37900,43.65240,0 -79.37650,43.64710,0</coordinates></LinearRing></outerBoundaryIs></Polygon></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Bloor Corridor (flexible extent)</name><description>A loosely defined region along Bloor St; part of Midtown. Extent may change.</description><styleUrl>#bloor</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>-79.40265,43.66705,0 -79.39380,43.66760,0 -79.37890,43.67250,0 -79.37410,43.67360,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
